Two small example models of NeuralAmpModelerCore (MIT, the licence text is next to them: example_models/lstm.nam and example_models/wavenet.nam of the repository at commit
0b3d3c97b0859a3a8c92a8628c4dd89a25eb5842). They are test data for linux/tests/namamp_render_test.sh: a tiny LSTM and a tiny WaveNet, not captures of a real amp.
